  "cards": [
    {"dot":"cyan","title":"Five contributions, one workflow","items":["Raghavi finds papers. Naila ranks by words and meaning.","Yu Yue fuses ranks and selects exact evidence. Chong Yao verifies it.","Kireeti connects the UI, grounding, scope controls and replay."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Active decision rules","items":["Anchors: top 3, cosine at least 0.5. Keep exact context within 512 pair tokens.","Then retain eligible context at relevance 0.65 or abstain. NLI threshold is separately 0.50.","Paper scope determines Supported, Contradicted, Conflicting or Insufficient."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Local inference and reusable results","items":["PyTorch and Transformers run pinned DeBERTa locally. Fresh discovery calls public APIs.","Session subset changes reuse original predictions. Imported replay has a separate local policy.","PDF follows a separate page-aware route. Quality flags never alter evidence or ranking."]},
    {"dot":"amber","title":"Measured results and their scope","items":["209 reserved internal SciFact claims: 67.9% accuracy, up from 56.5%; not an official hidden test.","Contradiction precision rose to 84.0%, but recall fell to 53.8%. Evidence F1 also fell.","RRF Recall@10: SciFact 95.6%, CSFCube 39.2%, RECIPER 93.7%; different retrieval protocols."]},
    {"dot":"rose","title":"Working diagnostics and experimental work","items":["Word-MASK occlusion works as bounded model sensitivity. Its small pilot is exploratory.","Integrated Gradients remains experimental after failed numerical gates. Local Qwen raw outputs passed 0 of 12 cases.","Grounded templates stay active. Human explanation and PDF reviews remain pending."]},
    {"dot":"slate","title":"What reliability means here","items":["212 frontend software tests passed. They do not establish scientific correctness.","Exact source IDs, quotations, hashes and scope remain inspectable. No database cluster is required.","Provider failures, missing text and model insufficiency remain different outcomes."]}
  ]
